10
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:43,860
Aramidin da amin tapno madlaw dagiti tat-tao arelehyoso da.

11
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:48,260
Kitaan nyo tikaakabat tinakaisuratan dagiti paset tinasantuan,

12
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:52,260
asurat nga adaka dagiti muging kantakyag da.

13
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,800
Kitaan nyo tika gayad tibariboy dagiti kawis da.

14
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:01,800
Magustuan da dagiti katanukan alugar ka dagiti fiyastaan,

15
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:05,840
ken kang runaan atugaw dagiti sinagoga.

16
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,720
Magustuan da ti makablaawan iti publiko,

17
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:12,400
ken maawagan iti maestro.

18
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:15,260
Di kayo paawagan iti maestro.

19
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:18,380
Agsipod taagkakabsat kay amin,

20
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:20,980
